  "goodToKnow": "Sprengen means to blow up (ein Gebäude sprengen, eine Bombe aus dem Zweiten Weltkrieg sprengen) and to burst or break open. Unexploded WWII bombs are still found and defused or detonated regularly in Germany. Figuratively, den Rahmen sprengen means to go beyond the scope, and eine Versammlung sprengen means to break up a meeting. Oddly, den Rasen sprengen means to water the lawn. Der Sprengstoff is an explosive."
